<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Performance comparison with traditional HPO methods</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 3.3 Performance comparison with traditional HPO methods ‣ 3 Results ‣ MetaLLMix : An XAI Aided LLM-Meta-learning Based Approach for Hyper-parameters Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reports the evaluation results of our proposed MetaLLMiX framework in comparison with RS and BO, using its optimal LLM configuration to demonstrate the framework’s effectiveness with an appropriate model selection.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">To assess the impact of different language models on MetaLLMiX performance, we evaluated nine open-source LLMs across all medical imaging datasets presented previously. The comparative results are reported in Table <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Performance comparison with traditional HPO methods ‣ 3 Results ‣ MetaLLMix : An XAI Aided LLM-Meta-learning Based Approach for Hyper-parameters Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<figure id="S3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>MetaLLMix comparison results against classic HPO methods</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S3.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Method</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CV Accuracy</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Response Time (s)</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T3.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training Time (s)</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S3.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="S3.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Alzheimer</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Random Search</th>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.90</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">4893.66</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">549.59</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Bayesian Opt.</th>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T3.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.93</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4773.95</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">140.45</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">MetaLLMiX (Ours)</th>
<td id="S3.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T3.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.92</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T3.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12.79</span></td>
